n-seong (Han Hyo-Joo) when her father suddenly dies and her brother goes missing. Then, by accident, good fortune arrives on Eun-seong's doorsteps when her kindness to an old woman yields the promise she'll inherits a vast fortune. Woo-han Seon (Lee Seung-Ki) is an arrogant young heir to this vast fortune. He has no idea about the value of money as he was spoiled by his wealthy grandmother and mother. One day, Woo-han's grandmother (Ban Hyo-Jung) delivers a wake-up call, she will give all of her fortune to Eun-seong.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":4452,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}